{"articleNo":"196685","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=196685&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[선발완료][근로]국가근로(교외) 모집 안내(코레일 동대구역, 봉곡도서관)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.08.23","hit":"4522","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span></span></span><font color=\"#660033\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\">선발이 완료되었음을 알려드립니다.</font></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong><font color=\"#660033\">- 선발된 학생들에게는 개별적으로&nbsp;연락 완료</font></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font color=\"#050099\">코레일(동대구역) 및 구미봉곡도서관</font></strong>에서&nbsp;학기 중 근무할 국가근로 학생을 모집합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 2018-2학기 국가근로 자격을 갖춘 재학생만 해당됨을 알려드립니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 성실하게 근무할 학생을 원합니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 선착순 선발 아닙니다. 신청기간 후 선발기준에 따라 선발합니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 다른 근로와 중복지원 안됩니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>1. 근무기간</strong> : 9월~12월 주말(2학기 중&nbsp;토요일/일요일 근무)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [예산&nbsp;및 사정에&nbsp;의해 시간 및 인원 축소 가능]</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>2. 근로지 내역</strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 코레일 동대구역</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 영어회화가 가능한 학생 요청</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 근로 업무 :&nbsp;여객안내,&nbsp;고객편의 서비스 제공, 여행상품 안내, 행정업무 지원</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. 봉곡도서관</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 도서관에서 근무한 경험이 있는 학생 요청</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 근로 업무 : 도서 정리 및 행정 업무 지원, 고객편의 서비스 제공</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>3. 신청 관련</strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;신청기간 : ~2018.8.27.(월) 18시</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;신청방법</font></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학과 / 학번 / 성명 / 연락처&nbsp;/ 근로지 반드시 기재</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 이메일(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u>dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr</u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">) 신청</span></font></span></span></p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>4. 선발 관련</strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\">선발 인원</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 코레일 동대구역 : 주말 1일 8시간 근무&nbsp;3명(평일 근무 없음)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 봉곡도서관 : 주말 1일 8시간&nbsp;근무&nbsp;2명(평일 근무 없음)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;선발 기준&nbsp; : 학기 초과자 제외, 2학기 국가근로 자격자 </font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 소득순위 : 1순위&gt;2순위&gt;3순위&gt;</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;소득순위가 동일할 경우 직전학기 성적</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;직전학기 성적이 동일할 경우 직전학기 이수학점</font></span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>5. 선발 결과</strong> : 8.28.(화)에 개별 연락</font></span></span></span></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
